<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SCP Foundation Database</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #1a1a1a; /* 深灰背景 */
            color: #d4d4d4; /* 浅灰文字 */
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; /* 打字机字体 */
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* 顶部警告横幅 */
        .warning-banner {
            background-color: #8b0000; /* 深红 */
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            border: 1px solid #ff4444;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* 主容器 */
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #222;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #8b0000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* 文档列表区域 */
        .doc-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .doc-item {
            background-color: #2a2a2a;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 4px solid #8b0000;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .doc-item:hover {
            transform: translateX(5px);
            background-color: #333;
        }

        .doc-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .doc-desc {
            color: #888;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- 顶部红色警告 -->
    <div class="warning-banner">
        ⚠️ 警告：仅限授权人员访问 / 非法入侵将被追踪
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>SCP FOUNDATION ARCHIVE</h1>
            <p style="text-align: center; color: #666;">Secure. Contain. Protect.</p>
        </header>

        <hr style="border-color: #444; margin: 30px 0;">

        <h2>📂 可用文档 / Available Documents</h2>
        
        <!-- 👇👇👇 这里是你要找的链接部分 👇👇👇 -->
        <ul class="doc-list">
            <li class="doc-item">
                <a href="scp-YHM-001.html" class="doc-link">
                    SCP-YHM-001 [世界]
                </a>
                <div class="doc-desc">
                    项目等级：Keter | 描述：关于世界本质的异常档案。
                </div>
            </li>
            
            <!-- 以后有新文档就加在这里 -->
        </ul>

        <footer style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.8em; color: #555;">
            &copy; SCP Foundation Database. All rights reserved.
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
